{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Darkness is chasing you -- literally. In The Rogue of Nexus you won't just have to fight monsters, but escape from a colossal and ever-present Hand determined to drag you into the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417340/extras/TRoN-Fight.gif?t=1743687116\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the frenetic pace of Half-Minute Hero and the addictive replayability of The Binding of Isaac, The Rogue of Nexus throws you into procedurally generated dungeons filled with loot, traps and hordes of bizarre creatures. Every step counts. Can you overcome destiny and escape the Hand's grasp?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417340/extras/TRoN-Hand.gif?t=1743687116\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Relentless pursuit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Hand is always lurking. Its presence dynamically alters the environment, forcing you to adapt and keep moving. There is no hiding: only survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417340/extras/TRoN-Dungeon.gif?t=1743687116\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive the dungeons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every path is unique! Explore countless dungeons filled with enemies, hidden treasures and deadly traps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417340/extras/TRoN-Upgrades.gif?t=1743687116\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Artifacts of Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a wide range of powerful artifacts that drastically alter your chances of survival. Find them all and become an unstoppable force (as long as you can overcome the Hand). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417340/extras/TRoN-WorldMap.gif?t=1743687116\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reach the end of the world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a vibrant and fascinating pixel art world with a dark and bizarre twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Rogue of Nexus, time is the most precious resource. Each dungeon is a frantic race against time, with the looming threat of the Hand constantly pushing you forward. Collect powerful artifacts to improve your skills. Each run is a new challenge, and each failure will give you the boost to get back up even stronger.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The World of Nexus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417340/51a9a3fa8c3a40adb6d0fec3a62f7ee303ce3d96.jpg"},{"name":"Caught","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417340/4304f91948dd417c169b8647514f6df704a14ab3.jpg"},{"name":"Failed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417340/0728e01a23374d4b9da12e19cfb2224d15b01fa6.jpg"},{"name":"Hand o' Clock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417340/fbb5cb738b9cb7d1e0d475130025ef5ffe1c61c2.jpg"},{"name":"Revenant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417340/aa7b7da606dbfc5cd9ec04498a7df6c3119ff0d0.jpg"},{"name":"Clash among the mountains","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417340/583f08c9a3b543cd49d8b1a40e616ce7ad52ebd8.jpg"},{"name":"The Werewolf forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417340/3aaebf47b5800b801ae50212287eb8c61638252f.jpg"},{"name":"Awake below the snow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417340/b6e2d555c6fd10403589fada6ed1ef6e30618c35.jpg"},{"name":"Fury of the lava","pa